# lt_weathering_pitzer.dat
# Low-temperature seafloor-weathering PHREEQC database.
#
# Base (activity model + aqueous speciation + authigenic precipitating
#   assemblage): ThermoChimie SIT database, sit.dat (v12a).
#   Giffaut et al. (2014); Grivé et al. (2015); SIT: Ciavatta (1980);
#   PHREEQC: Parkhurst & Appelo (2013).
# Added primary-silicate PHASES: SUPCRT-lineage (llnl.dat / SUPCRTBL,
#   Zimmer et al. 2016) — dissolution step only (far from equilibrium).
# RATES: Hermanska et al. (2022, 2023) via Kinec_v3.dat.
#
# Generated by make_database.py from databases in: /home/pavan/PhD/kamino/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/phreeqc/databases
#
# Provenance (phase/rate -> source):
#   BASE    pitzer.dat (pitzer activity model)
#   MASTER  Al: Kinec_v3.dat
#   SPECIES Al+3 = Al+3: Kinec_v3.dat
#   SPECIES H2O + Al+3 = Al(OH)+2 + H+: Kinec_v3.dat
#   SPECIES 2 H2O + Al+3 = Al(OH)2+ + 2 H+: Kinec_v3.dat
#   SPECIES 3 H2O + Al+3 = Al(OH)3 + 3 H+: Kinec_v3.dat
#   SPECIES 4 H2O + Al+3 = Al(OH)4- + 4 H+: Kinec_v3.dat
#   MASTER  Fe(+2): phreeqc.dat
#   MASTER  Fe(+3): phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+2 = Fe+3 + e-: phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+3 + H2O = FeOH+2 + H+: phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+3 + 2 H2O = Fe(OH)2+ + 2 H+: phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+3 + 3 H2O = Fe(OH)3 + 3 H+: phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+3 + 4 H2O = Fe(OH)4- + 4 H+: phreeqc.dat
#   SPECIES Fe+3 + Cl- = FeCl+2: phreeqc.dat
#   PHASES  Forsterite: llnl.dat (Forsterite)
#   PHASES  Fayalite: llnl.dat (Fayalite)
#   PHASES  Enstatite: llnl.dat (Enstatite)
#   PHASES  Diopside: llnl.dat (Diopside)
#   PHASES  Wollastonite: PHREEQC_ThermoddemV1.10_15Dec2020.dat (Wollastonite)
#   PHASES  Anorthite: llnl.dat (Anorthite)
#   PHASES  Akermanite: llnl.dat (Akermanite)
#   PHASES  Hedenbergite: llnl.dat (Hedenbergite)
#   PHASES  Ferrosilite: llnl.dat (Ferrosilite)
#   PHASES  Albite: llnl.dat (Albite)
#   PHASES  Nepheline: llnl.dat (Nepheline)
#   PHASES  K-Feldspar: llnl.dat (K-Feldspar)
#   PHASES  SiO2(am): llnl.dat (SiO2(am))
#   PHASES  Sepiolite(d): llnl.dat (Sepiolite)
#   PHASES  Siderite: llnl.dat (Siderite)
#   PHASES  Kaolinite: llnl.dat (Kaolinite)
#   PHASES  Goethite: llnl.dat (Goethite)
#   PHASES  Saponite-Na: llnl.dat (Saponite-Na)
#   PHASES  Greenalite: llnl.dat (Greenalite)
#   RATES   Forsterite: Kinec_v3.dat (Forsterite)
#   RATES   Fayalite: Kinec_v3.dat (Fayalite)
#   RATES   Enstatite: Kinec_v3.dat (Enstatite)
#   RATES   Diopside: Kinec_v3.dat (Diopside)
#   RATES   Wollastonite: Kinec_v3.dat (Wollastonite)
#   RATES   Anorthite: Kinec_v3.dat (Anorthite)
#   RATES   Albite: Kinec_v3.dat (Albite)
#   RATES   Nepheline: Kinec_v3.dat (Nepheline)
#   RATES   K-Feldspar: Kinec_v3.dat (K-Feldspar)

# pitzer.dat for calculating temperature and pressure dependence of reactions, and the specific conductance and viscosity of the solution, using
#   diffusion coefficients of species, molal volumina of aqueous species and minerals, and critical temperatures and pressures of gases used in Peng-Robinson's EOS.
# Details are given at the end of this file.

