NaOH     Na+   1  OH-    1
KCl      K+    1  Cl-    1
K2SO4    K+    2  SO4-2  1
HCO3     K+    1  HCO3-  1
K2CO3    K+    2  CO3-2  1
KOH      K+    1  OH-    1
HCl      H+    1  Cl-    1
